Register JWT Filter

This is where your custom filter becomes part of Spring Security.

http.addFilterBefore(
        jwtAuthenticationFilter,
        UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter.class
);

Why before?

Default flow:

UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter

↓

AuthorizationFilter

Our flow:

JwtAuthenticationFilter

↓

UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter

↓

AuthorizationFilter

JWT authentication must happen before authorization decisions are made.